### Dijet Cross Section

The formal equation for the dijet cross section is:

\[\frac{d^{2}\sigma}{dM_{ij}d|y_{max}|}=\frac{1}{\int\mathcal{L}dt}\cdot\frac{1}{ \Delta M_{ij}\Delta|y_{max}|}\cdot N^{corr} \tag{5.27}\]

where \(N^{corr}\) are the corrected yields, \(\Delta M_{ij}\) are the invariant mass bins, \(\Delta y_{max}\) is the rapidity range and \(\int\mathcal{L}dt=8.47pb^{-1}\pm 13\%\) is the integrated luminosity for JP2 trigger.

